# Runtime-written data files — mutated live via the app's own API routes
# (fs.writeFileSync), not edited through git. Tracking these meant every
# Cloudways "Deployment via GIT" pull reset/deleted live production data
# back to whatever was last committed (usually an empty seed value),
# silently wiping anything added since. See routes/ad-suggestions.js,
# routes/announcement.js, routes/customer-questions.js, routes/templates.js.
data/ad-suggestions.json
data/announcement.json
data/announcement-versions.json
data/customer-questions.json
data/templates.json
